OL,3,GNEWSACall for tougher action over
OL,4,Aillegal e-bikes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA call has been made for tougher action
OL,7,Fto be taken against people using
OL,8,Fillegal e-bikes and e-scooters amid
OL,9,Fconcerns about dangerous riding.
OL,11,FMark Ieronimo, Hull City Council's
OL,12,Fportfolio holder for transport and
OL,13,Finfrastructure, has written to the
OL,14,Ftransport secretary calling for clearer
OL,15,Frules and tougher enforcement.
OL,17,FHe said his constituents felt unsafe
OL,18,Fbecause e-bikes that had been illegally
OL,19,Fmodified were being ridden dangerously
OL,20,Fthere.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
