OL,3,GNEWSACall for tougher action over
OL,4,Aillegal e-bikes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA government spokesperson said illegal
OL,7,Fe-bikes had "no place on our roads and
OL,8,Fpavements", and a change in the law
OL,9,Fmeant police could seize the bikes
OL,10,Fwithout needing to issue a warning
OL,11,Ffirst.
